            <history xml:id="history_220N20111">
               <p xml:id="idm90">As "Dulce cum soldalibus" (HartW 271), "Her ved dette Gammensbord" is written specifically for "Sange for Studenterforeningen" which was the first Danish song book with music. It is noticeable that this publication not only comprises well know tunes but also new music.</p>
